{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:0.4", "PA_ja_167:1.1"], "en": "7. The Samiddhi Jātaka “Without having eaten, you beg for alms, O bhikkhu;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:1.2"], "en": "indeed, you do not beg for alms after having eaten.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:1.3"], "en": "Having become a bhikkhu, live as a bhikkhu;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:1.4"], "en": "let not the time pass you by.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:2.1"], "en": "I do not know the time.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:2.2"], "en": "The opportune time is not seen;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:2.3"], "en": "therefore, I shall go for alms without eating,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:2.4"], "en": "lest time should pass me by.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_167:3.1"], "en": "The Samiddhi Jātaka is the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
